        projModel = "Cold 100°C favors equilibrium theoretically but reaction freezes kinetically; 450°C with V₂O₅ converts SO₂ fast. Since 1–2 atm already yields >98% SO₃ at low pressure cost, extreme 500 atm steel vessels waste capital.",
