        misc2 = MisconceptionAnalysis("Scratching a zinc-galvanized roof causes the exposed iron beneath to rust faster.", "Bare iron touches rain.", "Zinc is MORE reactive than Iron, so it acts as a sacrificial anode corroding first to shield exposed iron!", "Scratch fails ONLY on LESS-reactive coatings like Tin cans."),
